+
+**⟨2⟩2.**  Nonzero endpoint selection in a gapped toric code does not furnish
+a radiative soft theorem.
+
+*Justification.*  The checker exhibits a nonzero fixed-energy sector and only
+tests exact algebraic blocks.  It supplies no gapless asymptotic particle,
+current, Ward limit, or Taylor coefficient.  This is the existing
