+
+**⟨2⟩3.**  No `d=3` fall-off or memory conclusion is drawn.
+
+*Justification.*  The computation is finite-volume and contains no radial
+coordinate.  In particular it cannot compare radiative `r^{-1/2}` and
+Coulombic `r^0` orders or define a permanent displacement.  This leaves the
+`2+1` warnings intact and consumes no claim beyond `A-INDEX-PEPS` and
