+
+**⟨2⟩4.**  Therefore the result is only the advertised categorical anyon
+selection/nonvacuity result.
+
+*Justification.*  This follows from ⟨1⟩6.⟨2⟩1--3 and the exact support
+equation (PTC.11), checked by `peps_pt_check.py` `PEPS-PT-C7`.  **QED for the
+scoped claim.**
