+
+*Justification.*  These exclusions are the three binding warnings, while the
+positive content is exactly (PTC.11), `A-INDEX-PEPS`, and
+`peps_pt_check.py` `PEPS-PT-C7`--`C8`.  **QED for the scoped claim.**
+
